# Your Redis settings. Included after the generated base configuration, so values set here win.
# Restart the app after editing. Reference: https://redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/management/config/
#
# Port, TLS certificate, password and data directory are managed by the package - don't set them here.
#
# Examples:
# maxmemory-policy allkeys-lru
# appendonly no
# databases 32
